@startuml sequence_form_refactor
!theme plain
autonumber

title Диаграмма последовательности: Рефакторинг формы (п.4)\nОдин класс окна - разные контроллеры

actor Пользователь as User
participant "HTML/JS\n(View - ОДНА ФОРМА)" as View
participant "FastAPI\n(App)" as FastAPI
participant "FormController\n(УНИВЕРСАЛЬНЫЙ)" as FormController
participant "RepositoryObserver\n(Subject)" as Observer
participant "ClientDBAdapter\n(Repository)" as Adapter
participant "Client_rep_DB\n(Model)" as DB
database "PostgreSQL" as Database

== Сценарий 1: Добавление (mode='add') ==

User -> View: Нажимает "Добавить"
activate View

View -> View: openFormModal('add')

View -> FastAPI: GET /api/form/add
activate FastAPI

FastAPI -> FormController: new FormController(\nrepository, mode='add')
activate FormController

FormController -> FormController: get_form_data()

note right of FormController
  РЕФАКТОРИНГ:
  Логика отображения
  (пустая форма)
  в контроллере!
end note

FormController --> FastAPI: {\n  "mode": "add",\n  "title": "Добавление клиента",\n  "data": {\n    "name": "",\n    "ownership_type": "",\n    ...\n  }\n}
deactivate FormController

FastAPI --> View: JSON Response
deactivate FastAPI

View -> View: Отображает ПУСТУЮ форму

View --> User: Показывает форму
deactivate View

User -> View: Заполняет и отправляет
activate View

View -> FastAPI: POST /api/form/submit\n?mode=add\n{...client_data...}
activate FastAPI

FastAPI -> FormController: new FormController(\nrepository, mode='add')
activate FormController

FormController -> FormController: submit_form(client_data)
FormController -> FormController: _validate_client_data(data)

FormController -> Observer: add_client(client_data)
activate Observer
Observer -> Adapter: add_client(client_data)
activate Adapter
Adapter -> DB: add_client(client_data)
activate DB
DB -> Database: INSERT INTO clients
activate Database
Database --> DB: new_id
deactivate Database
DB --> Adapter: new Client
deactivate DB
Adapter --> Observer: new Client
deactivate Adapter
Observer -> Observer: notify('client_added', client)
Observer --> FormController: new Client
deactivate Observer

FormController --> FastAPI: {\n  "success": True,\n  "client": {...}\n}
deactivate FormController

FastAPI --> View: JSON Response
deactivate FastAPI

View -> View: Обновляет таблицу
View --> User: Показывает результат
deactivate View

== Сценарий 2: Редактирование (mode='edit') ==

User -> View: Нажимает "Изменить"
activate View

View -> View: openFormModal('edit', client_id)

View -> FastAPI: GET /api/form/edit\n?client_id=5
activate FastAPI

FastAPI -> FormController: new FormController(\nrepository,\nmode='edit',\nclient_id=5)
activate FormController

FormController -> FormController: get_form_data()

FormController -> Observer: get_by_id(5)
activate Observer
Observer -> Adapter: get_by_id(5)
activate Adapter
Adapter -> DB: get_by_id(5)
activate DB
DB -> Database: SELECT * WHERE id=5
activate Database
Database --> DB: row
deactivate Database
DB --> Adapter: Client object
deactivate DB
Adapter --> Observer: Client object
deactivate Adapter
Observer --> FormController: Client object
deactivate Observer

note right of FormController
  РЕФАКТОРИНГ:
  Логика отображения
  (заполненная форма)
  в контроллере!
end note

FormController --> FastAPI: {\n  "mode": "edit",\n  "title": "Редактирование",\n  "data": {\n    "client_id": 5,\n    "name": "ООО Ромашка",\n    ...\n  }\n}
deactivate FormController

FastAPI --> View: JSON Response
deactivate FastAPI

View -> View: Отображает ЗАПОЛНЕННУЮ форму

View --> User: Показывает форму\nс данными
deactivate View

User -> View: Редактирует и отправляет
activate View

View -> FastAPI: POST /api/form/submit\n?mode=edit&client_id=5\n{...client_data...}
activate FastAPI

FastAPI -> FormController: new FormController(\nrepository,\nmode='edit',\nclient_id=5)
activate FormController

FormController -> FormController: submit_form(client_data)
FormController -> FormController: _validate_client_data(data)

FormController -> Observer: update_client(5, client_data)
activate Observer
Observer -> Adapter: update_client(5, client_data)
activate Adapter
Adapter -> DB: update_client(5, client_data)
activate DB
DB -> Database: UPDATE clients\nWHERE id=5
activate Database
Database --> DB: success
deactivate Database
DB --> Adapter: success
deactivate DB
Adapter --> Observer: success
deactivate Adapter
Observer -> Observer: notify('client_updated', client)
Observer --> FormController: updated Client
deactivate Observer

FormController --> FastAPI: {\n  "success": True,\n  "client": {...}\n}
deactivate FormController

FastAPI --> View: JSON Response
deactivate FastAPI

View -> View: Обновляет таблицу
View --> User: Показывает результат
deactivate View

note over View, Database
  ИТОГ РЕФАКТОРИНГА (п.4):
  - ОДИН класс окна (formModal)
  - Логика разного отображения в FormController
  - mode='add' → пустая форма
  - mode='edit' → заполненная форма
end note

@enduml